flowchart TB
  O[(Observations<br/>equalities, GE / LE bounds,<br/>sigma by source)] --> CV[Cover sequences<br/>thickness fields >= 0]
  DTM[DTM / ground surface] --> CV
  CV --> RH[Rockhead = ground - cover<br/>checked against rockhead contacts]
  O --> REF[Reference bedrock surface<br/>kriging + active-set inequalities<br/>fault barriers with throw correction]
  MAP[(Map polygons and contacts<br/>scale-dependent tolerance)] --> REF
  MAP --> CV
  O --> ISO[Isochores of intermediate units]
  REF --> ST[Stacking: reference -/+ isochores]
  ISO --> ST
  ST --> RES[Residual kriging per surface<br/>honours every contact,<br/>faults as barriers]
  RES --> CL[Clamp: no crossing surfaces<br/>erosional truncation at rockhead]
  RH --> CL
  CL --> UNC[Std, confidence, class<br/>Observed / Interpolated /<br/>Inferred / Speculative]
  CL --> MC[Conditional Gaussian random fields<br/>unit probabilities]
